:: Ending: The Made Thief [ending] {"position":"1400,970","size":"100,100"}
<span class="stub"><span class="beat"><b>ENDING 2 — THE MADE THIEF.</b> Reached on low innocence. Oliver takes Dodger's place; Dodger has been transported. The game closes on a new boy coming up the stairs at Field Lane.</span><span class="note">The ending the novel refuses, and the reason for building it this way. Should be written to feel like an achievement and then to curdle. Explicit callback to the Barnet passage — same offer, other side of it.</span></span>

