:: Ending: Jacob's Island [ending] {"position":"1400,1180","size":"100,100"}
<span class="stub"><span class="beat"><b>ENDING 3 — JACOB'S ISLAND.</b> Reached via `$sikesTrusts` + low innocence. The rooftop at Folly Ditch, the crowd below, Sikes hanging himself by accident with his own rope. Oliver on the roof with him.</span><span class="note">Structural: the ending with no rescue and no name. Also the one that best uses a 3D scene, if the DSS toolkit gets carried over.</span></span>

